  "summary": "I’m a Data &amp; Automation Software Engineer at Yoppify with a bachelor's degree in information systems from BYU. I have experience in backend development, process automation, and web development using Python, ASP.NET, Node.js, and React. I work frequently with SQL and data analytics, and have dabbled in machine learning. I enjoy solving complex problems and streamlining workflows with technology. Some of my recent projects include a QA automation program and multiple full-stack web apps built under tight deadlines.",
