      "description": "As a Data and Automation Software Engineer at Yoppify, I design and implement backend tools that streamline internal business processes and enable data-driven decision-making. My work focuses on Python development, backend automation, system integration, and data workflows. This role sits at the intersection of software engineering, data analytics, and business process improvement.\n\nHere are some of my responsibilities:\n- Developing backend applications in Python to automate and optimize internal operations\n- Querying, transforming, and analyzing both internal and client data\n- Designing data workflows that power automation and reporting tools\n- Creating dashboards in Domo to visualize KPIs and business performance metrics\n- Establishing QA/QC protocols to ensure system accuracy and stability\n- Supporting AI/ML initiatives and contributing to cloud-based infrastructure\n- Collaborating cross-functionally with operations and leadership to deliver high-impact solutions\n- Occasionally assisting with app development",
